$solutionguide .= '<p><b>Step 3 &mdash; Pivot to the optimum.</b> The most negative entry in the profit row is the coefficient of the variable with the larger profit per unit, so that variable enters. The ratio test on the two resource rows picks the leaving variable. After pivoting, both resource constraints are tight at the optimum, so the optimal solution is the intersection of the two constraint lines:</p>';
