<p>Consider the matrix equation <code>AX = B</code>, where</p>
<p style="text-align:center">`A = [[$A[0][0], $A[0][1], $A[0][2]], [$A[1][0], $A[1][1], $A[1][2]], [$A[2][0], $A[2][1], $A[2][2]]]` &nbsp;&nbsp; and &nbsp;&nbsp; `B = [[$B[0]], [$B[1]], [$B[2]]]`</p>
