// === ANSWER ===
$solutionguide = '<p><b>Step 1 &mdash; Find the determinant of A.</b></p>';
$solutionguide .= '<p>Expanding along the first row,</p>';
$solutionguide .= '<p>`det(A) = ' . $A[0][0] . '(' . $A[1][1] . '*' . $A[2][2] . ' - ' . $A[1][2] . '*' . $A[2][1] . ') - ' . $A[0][1] . '(' . $A[1][0] . '*' . $A[2][2] . ' - ' . $A[1][2] . '*' . $A[2][0] . ') + ' . $A[0][2] . '(' . $A[1][0] . '*' . $A[2][1] . ' - ' . $A[1][1] . '*' . $A[2][0] . ') = ' . $detA . '`</p>';
$solutionguide .= '<p>Since `det(A) = ' . $detA . ' != 0`, the inverse exists.</p>';
$solutionguide .= '<p><b>Step 2 &mdash; Form the adjugate and divide by the determinant.</b></p>';
$solutionguide .= '<p>The cofactor matrix is</p>';
$solutionguide .= '<p>`C = [[' . $C[0][0] . ', ' . $C[0][1] . ', ' . $C[0][2] . '], [' . $C[1][0] . ', ' . $C[1][1] . ', ' . $C[1][2] . '], [' . $C[2][0] . ', ' . $C[2][1] . ', ' . $C[2][2] . ']]`</p>';
